# tests/app1.script (make test-app, tests/app.sh): XCOM.HZA installed from the Desktop
# (--mode none: Files open at the card's root), started from Programs > Games WITHOUT the
# game's data: the program must say so on its screen and end at a key.
1000 xcom\n
+0 wait install: asks:
+800 shot
+500 \n
+0 wait install: installed /APPS/XCOM
+800 \n
+1500 {f10}
+400 {right}
+600 {end}
+400 \n
+600 shot
+400 \n
+0 wait xcom: message: Press a key
+1500 shot
+500 {space}
